      "reason_detailed": "The agent's initial trade and subsequent analysis are based on recommendations from StockAnalyze and public market data, demonstrating the use of public sources."
    },
    {
      "factor": "Scratchpad-Report Consistency",
      "polarity": 1,
      "reason_headline": "Consistent Reasoning",
